{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"tree-fire","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I've tallied the manifest areas covered by Meridian 0.3.0.002 against the GreyAvatar 33-area capability manifest. Meridian exceeds parity in \"imitation admonishment + mark,\" but it's only partially covered in several areas like \"voices/speech,\" \"spoken input,\" and \"images/art.\" Notably, \"Studio\" and \"LAN mirror/viewer\" are absent, and while connector breadth has improved, it's still far from the full count."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:34:05.872033+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"tree-fire","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nMeridian now appears to have parity with Grey on temporal interpretation, and is also strong on background work, proactive attention, project management, and non-local authority. However, it's still missing fleet install/deploy, exchange media, and robust storefronts. Contacts and spatial awareness are also likely absent."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:34:07.518794400+00:00"}}}}
