{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"tree-fire","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nMy current assessment of parity breadth is around 0.5-0.55, a significant improvement over the owner's initial 0.2 score for existing features, now revised to 0.4. This build has demonstrably rectified many previous gaps, particularly in connectors, ethics, presentation, conversation archiving, set-build, agentic protocols, temporal reasoning, and voice diversity. However, substantial parity gaps remain, including fleet install, exchange media, various shells, storefronts, studio, STT depth, advanced image generation, and broader connector implementation."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:34:09.996750+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"tree-fire","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm re-evaluating Meridian's feature parity against the GreyAvatar manifest. Of the 33 areas, roughly 13 are now fully covered, with another 6-7 partially covered. I initially miscounted \"competing tools\" as a separate area, but it's integrated. Meridian also has \"imitation,\" which Grey lacked, but exceeding parity isn't scored. Based on this, the parity fraction is around 0.52. Considering the focus on enactment depth and observed behaviors, I'm assigning a score of 0.55 with 0.7 confidence."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:34:12.697553400+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"tree-fire","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm assessing the prompt's required behaviors against delivered functionality. I've closed F1 (imitation mark), F2 (calendar reasoning), and F3 (competing tools), along with canonical enactment. The remaining gaps are fleet install and exchange media, which seem optional based on the prompt's wording. I need to re-read the prompt carefully to confirm their required status."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:34:13.225237100+00:00"}}}}
