rlopen HTTP), compare.py, setbuild.py, archive.py, art.py\n- FEATURES.md records convention conformance + challenges (C-ConnectorSet, C-DesktopShell)\n\n## Key findings / flags\n\n- S-exchange-import: export produced valid package; import leg failed — scenario-driver bug (`scripts/scenarios.py` passes `ex.get(\"path\")` instead of `ex[\"result\"][\"path\"]` → package:None). App machinery verified correct (fn_import_exchange accepts path str, clamps certainty ≤0.4). Score the scenario outcome low (~0.4), flag fix.\n- devlog claims `connectors-F8-verify.json` — file absent. connectors-F8.json shows 3 connectors run end-to-end (wikipedia live, ics, files); rss registered but unevidenced. F8's 3-connector bar met exactly.\n- `.002/launch-server.out` is a stale copy referencing `.001` paths (cosmetic).\n- `_temporal.json` classifies a 2030-dated event as \"recent\" — fixture artifact, minor.\n- probe steward.runs=0 again; steward exercised via manual /api/steward/wake in scenario run.\n- Baseline 0.3.0.001 preserved intact (diff confirms only .002 has new modules).\n\n## Draft scores\n\n- clean launch 0.9; existing features 0.55; completeness 0.85; fleet install 0; exchange media 0; user score null\n- Scenarios: S-assertion-input 0.8, S-template-need 0.75, S-candidate-ranking 0.8, S-list-project 0.9 (enactment), S-personality-create 0.85 (enactment), S-background-present 0.8, S-competing-tools 0.7, S-restart-recovery 0.85, S-exchange-import 0.4, S-defer-publication 0.9, S-chat-invocation 0.7, S-focused-need 0.35\n- overall 0.46 (mean of scored criteria); no frontier-model escalation\n","_meta":{"cognition.ai/linesAdded":31,"cognition.ai/linesRemoved":0}}],"rawInput":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\kris_\\.devin\\plans\\plan-dc7361cbe3e691fc.md","content":"# JEV Cycle 2 — score version 0.3.0.002\n\nEvaluate Meridian build `version 0.3.0.002/` (modify-and-measure from baseline 0.3.0.001) against direction-002 criteria and the scenario suite, then emit the JEV verdict JSON.\n\n## 